{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1d980aabf521d70a","name":"Environmental Filters","source":{"id":"source:reference-1d980aabf521d70a","title":"Environmental Filters","revision":19652,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:21:35Z","sha256":"bebca7629554e847a28ee81279f640effc7878c61390d0e8759f56c260bd8a65","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19652","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Environmental%20Filters&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1d980aabf521d70a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Gargantuan or Larger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000 (Base)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Environmental Filters allow a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," to support more than one set of environmental conditions. This is common on luxury liners that wish to provide comfortable quarters for multiple ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," at once. Normally, only a few rooms are provided with an alternative environment, but entire sections of a ship can be given different gravity, atmosphere, and lighting if desired. On rare occasions, these systems have been used offensively by making things difficult for hijackers or pirates.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", a character with administrator access to the ship's computer in the command or engineering center of a ship can make DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to flood any section with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Toxic Atmosphere"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Toxic_Atmosphere","referenceId":"reference:2548fcf4fea47c34"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extreme Temperatures"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extreme_Temperatures"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," (Mild), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Smoke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Smoke","referenceId":"reference:29b52bfcccd01518"},", or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gravity","referenceId":"reference:19602d23667cf93d"}," fluctuation (Low, High, or Zero-Gravity).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
